volatiles cant be reordered past each other but says nothing about non volatiles. There are no partial barriers so 
use the full barrier.

And yes if you mark a variable as volatile then it wont have other optimizations that assume the variable cannot be set
from a place that the compiler has knowledge of (like interrupt handlers / device / signal handlers)

